<section id="ways">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <h2>Three more ways an alarm starts</h2>
      <p>The parent never has to decide they are being scammed. Each alarm starts from something that happened, and lands in the same room.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ways">
      <article class="way" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <h3>A ride alone at night</h3>
          <p class="desc">Before an Ola, Uber, Rapido or auto ride, anyone in the group writes how long it should take and pastes the app's share-trip message. It runs only when someone starts it.</p>
          <p class="aside">A code word, <code>@ride-watch pizza</code>, raises the alarm at once, for when she can't talk freely.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vis">
          <ol class="t no-time">
            <li><span class="from">Riya<small>family</small></span><div class="body"><p>@ride-watch 25 min</p></div></li>
          </ol>
          <ol class="ticks" aria-label="What happens if Riya doesn't say she reached">
            <li><span class="bar"><i data-tick></i></span><b>25 min</b>Expected arrival</li>
            <li><span class="bar"><i data-tick></i></span><b>+10 min</b>Ride watch asks if she reached</li>
            <li class="a"><span class="bar"><i data-tick></i></span><b>+5 min</b>Alarm, with the driver's details</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="way" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <h3>A missed call</h3>
          <p class="desc">Mom saves the family's number as "Family SOS". When a caller scares her, she gives it a missed call. Call watch rejects the call, so it costs her nothing.</p>
          <p class="aside">One tap on a number she already knows how to dial. No app, no typing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vis">
          <ol class="t no-time">
            <li><span class="from">Call watch<small>service, no AI</small></span><div class="body"><p>Mom gave a missed call. Who's calling Mom?</p></div></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="way" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <h3>A question that is really a scam</h3>
          <p class="desc">Many scams reach a parent as an ordinary "how do I…" question. Line checks every request against a danger list before helping, and answers in the language the parent writes in.</p>
          <p class="aside">Runs on Switch's WhatsApp and SMS adapters, which are open pull requests. Everything else on this page runs on Switch as released.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vis">
          <ol class="t no-time">
            <li><span class="from">Papa<small>on WhatsApp</small></span><div class="body"><p>bank wale bol rahe AnyDesk download karo</p></div></li>
            <li>
              <span class="from">Line<small>AI agent</small></span>
              <div class="body">
                <div class="langs" role="tablist" aria-label="Line's reply language">
                  <button role="tab" type="button" id="t-hl" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="p-hl">Hinglish</button>
                  <button role="tab" type="button" id="t-hi" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="p-hi" tabindex="-1"><span class="deva" lang="hi">हिन्दी</span></button>
                  <button role="tab" type="button" id="t-en" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="p-en" tabindex="-1">English</button>
                </div>
                <p role="tabpanel" id="p-hl" aria-labelledby="t-hl">Kripya rukiye. Koi asli bank, police ya company kabhi app download karne ya code batane ko nahi kehti. Yeh dhokha hai. Phone par aur kuch mat kijiye. Madad ke liye 1930 par call karein. Main aapke parivaar ko bata raha hoon, woh aapko phone karenge.</p>
                <p role="tabpanel" id="p-hi" aria-labelledby="t-hi" class="deva" lang="hi" hidden>कृपया रुकिए। कोई असली बैंक, पुलिस या कंपनी कभी ऐप डाउनलोड करने या कोड बताने को नहीं कहती। यह धोखा है। फ़ोन पर और कुछ मत कीजिए। मदद के लिए 1930 पर कॉल करें। मैं आपके परिवार को बता रहा हूँ, वे आपको फ़ोन करेंगे।</p>
                <p role="tabpanel" id="p-en" aria-labelledby="t-en" hidden>Please stop. No real bank, police or company ever asks you to install an app or share a code. This is a scam. Don't do anything more on the phone. You can call 1930 for help. I'm telling your family now, they will call you.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="from">Line<small>in the family group</small></span>
              <div class="body"><p><span class="alarm">Line alarm: Papa may be in a scam</span><br>He wrote: "bank wale bol rahe AnyDesk download karo"<br>Matches: screen-sharing app asked for by a "bank" caller<br>I told him to stop, gave 1930, and said you'll call.</p><p>@guardian over to you.</p></div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const tabs = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.langs [role="tab"]')];
  const select = (tab: HTMLButtonElement) =>
    tabs.forEach((t) => {
      const on = t === tab;
      t.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(on));
      t.tabIndex = on ? 0 : -1;
      document.getElementById(t.getAttribute("aria-controls")!)!.hidden = !on;
    });
  tabs.forEach((t, i) => {
    t.addEventListener("click", () => select(t));
    t.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
      const d = e.key === "ArrowRight" ? 1 : e.key === "ArrowLeft" ? -1 : 0;
      if (!d) return;
      const next = tabs[(i + d + tabs.length) % tabs.length];
      select(next);
      next.focus();
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  #ways { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .ways { margin-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px); }
  .way { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr); gap: 32px 80px; padding-block: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); }
  .way h3 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3rem); line-height: 0.98; font-stretch: 75%; font-weight: 630; }
  .desc { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 28rem; }
  .aside { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 28rem; }
  .vis { display: grid; gap: 28px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .way { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }

  .ticks { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 4px; }
  .ticks li { font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--ink-soft); padding-right: 12px; }
  .bar { display: block; height: 2px; background: var(--rule); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .bar i { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--ink); transform-origin: left; }
  .a .bar i { background: var(--stamp); }
  .ticks b { display: block; color: var(--ink); font: 500 0.875rem/1.5 var(--mono); }
  .a b { color: var(--stamp); }

  .langs { display: flex; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .langs button { font: 500 0.875rem/1.4 var(--sans); padding: 0 0 3px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; background: none; color: var(--ink-soft); cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; }
  .langs button[aria-selected="true"] { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink); }
</style>
